;; Domain   : Biology
;; Problem  : Parietal bone taxonomy
;; Version  : Merge.kif + Anatomy.kif axioms; +1 denotes FOF formulation 1.
;; English  : A left parietal bone is a body part through the cranial and head bone hierarchy.
;;
;; Refs     :
;; Source   : SUMO Merge.kif, Anatomy.kif
;; Names    : SMO_BIO_0013
;;
;; Status   : Theorem
;; Comments : Combines Anatomy.kif bone subclasses with Bone subclass BodyPart in Merge.kif.
